#. module: primate_project_area
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:primate_project_area.field_primate_area__code
msgid ""
"Stable identifier used by the dashboard payload, the tours and the tests. "
"Unlike the database id, it is the same across databases."
msgstr "Identificador estable que usan el payload del dashboard, los tours y los tests. A diferencia del id de la base, es el mismo en todas."

